    "created_at": "2016-11-07T15:41:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-07T15:41:05Z",
    "body": "Oh, I would have expected 2, not 3 :(. That indicates to me this may be too confusing of a concept to add, and just using `Array.from().length`, or asking TC39 to add an %IteratorPrototype%.length so that you can do `url.searchParams.keys().length` vs. `url.searchParams.values().length`, would be better.\n",
