    "created_at": "2016-11-07T19:35:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-07T19:35:24Z",
    "body": "Yeah, MultiMaps are intended to be usable as Maps, too, and the difference in expected size between the two use-cases is a footgun if you make the choice either way. +1 to adding .length to iterators.\n",
