    "created_at": "2023-02-17T12:17:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-02-17T12:17:09Z",
    "body": "Sorry to show up towing a bikeshed, but how about\r\n```idl\r\nunsigned long count(optional USVString key, optional USVString value);\r\n```\r\nallowing you to do\r\n```js\r\nconst p = new URLSearchParams('a=1&b=2&b=3&b=3');\r\np.count();  // 4\r\np.count('b');  // 3\r\np.count('b', '3');  // 2\r\n```\r\n?",
